<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - THROW</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .pixel-face {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            background-color: var(--accent-pink);
            border: var(--border-width) solid var(--text-color);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-offset) var(--shadow-offset) 0px 0px var(--text-color);
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        .eye {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: var(--text-color);
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
        }

        .eye.left { left: 25px; }
        .eye.right { right: 25px; }

        .mouth {
            width: 60px;
            height: 10px;
            background-color: var(--text-color);
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 30px;
        }

        .tear {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background-color: #0000ff; /* Blue tear */
            position: absolute;
            top: 60px;
            left: 30px;
            box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 0 #0000ff; /* Pixelated drop */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo-box">
            </> THROW
        </div>
    </header>

    <main style="align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
        <div class="options-card" style="max-width: 500px; width: 100%; text-align: center;">
            <div class="pixel-face">
                <div class="eye left"></div>
                <div class="eye right"></div>
                <div class="tear"></div>
                <div class="mouth"></div>
            </div>
            
            <h1 style="text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Too Late!</h1>
            
            <div class="neo-box" style="padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: #fff;">
                <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold;">
                    THIS FILE HAS BEEN DELETED OR NEVER EXISTED.
                </p>
                <p>We don't keep logs. Once it's gone, it's really gone.</p>
            </div>

            <a href="/" class="neo-btn" style="text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">UPLOAD SOMETHING NEW</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> THROW FILE SHARE. NO LOGS. AUTO-DELETE.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>